  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures - Cooperation Facility - Strategic Communication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action will support the implementation of strategic communication activities, in line with the multi annual strategic plan, as well as the new integrated approach to communication in EU&#xbf;s external actions. By bringing together political communication, brand awareness campaigns and public diplomacy networks, we aim at positioning the EU as a trusted and reliable partner of Bangladesh, while profiling the Global Gateway strategy as our offer to address today&#xbf;s challenges, essentially when it comes to supporting Bangladesh in its LDC graduation.</narrative>
  </description>
